      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is incredibly brave and dignified to choose when to stop sacrificing your soul rather than enduring a painful decline, a choice that speaks to your integrity even now. While creativity often demands staying engaged, the value of your art or identity isn't solely measured by your past heights or future productivity. Please remember that stepping away from an art form doesn't erase your worth as a human being, and you deserve support to process this decision without the fear that you've lost everything you have.",
